,$ are the vertical asymptotes of the function. Hence, statement II is false.\n\n- The graph of the function doesn't intersect the $y$-axis, as $x=0$ is not in the domain of $y=\\operatorname{csc}⁡x.$ Hence, statement III is true." 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1000 #edb/ref 17592186248477 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1000 #edb/ref 17592186248478 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1000 #edb/ref 17592186248479 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1000 #edb/ref 17592186248480 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1000 #edb/ref 17592186248481 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1041 "selection" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1104 #edb/ref 17592186248479 13194139533722 true] [17592186248476 1110 #uuid "65f19d68-e4f0-5c3a-855e-b6da1a0ce440" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248477 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248477 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533722 true] [17592186248477 1111 #uuid "737d3937-2c60-56b3-9d10-ac94f2ef320b" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248478 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248478 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533722 true] [17592186248478 1111 #uuid "fdfec527-d381-52c9-957f-8e264e9e35c9" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248479 1034 "III only" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248479 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533722 true] [17592186248479 1111 #uuid "d08954fd-628f-5eba-995f-ba3d2710998c" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248480 1034 "I and II only" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248480 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533722 true] [17592186248480 1111 #uuid "b51a7a87-7aae-53e0-a04f-f828bb8f4511" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248481 1034 "II only" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248481 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533722 true] [17592186248481 1111 #uuid "761f856e-7e90-553b-b58a-42945fa39f5b" 13194139533722 true] [17592186248482 1017 #edb/ref 17592186248483 13194139533722 true] [17592186248482 1089 "q-65308" 1